{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 22, "text": "从一些保存较古的布依族服饰、工艺上可以看出，布依族纺织文化以种棉纺布力基", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1473, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "从一些保存较古的布依族服饰、工艺上可以看出，布依族纺织文化以种棉纺布力基", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1473, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 23, "text": "础，形成了纺织、刺绣、挑花、镶缀、织锦等系列传统工艺纺织文化事象。其布依布、蜡染、", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1537, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "础，形成了纺织、刺绣、挑花、镶缀、织锦等系列传统工艺纺织文化事象。其布依布、蜡染、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1537, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 24, "text": "织锦、刺绣是这一系列文化事象中久负盛名的纺织工艺。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1601, "w": 981, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "织锦、刺绣是这一系列文化事象中久负盛名的纺织工艺。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1601, "w": 981, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 25, "text": "（1）布依布：亦称土花布、土呢子等。布依布历来有较高的声誉，花色品种较多，主要", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1666, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（1）布依布：亦称土花布、土呢子等。布依布历来有较高的声誉，花色品种较多，主要", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1666, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 26, "text": "有斗纹、方格纹、桂花纹等。长期以来，一直自产于民间，是布依族人民缝制衣服、床单的", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1730, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有斗纹、方格纹、桂花纹等。长期以来，一直自产于民间，是布依族人民缝制衣服、床单的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1730, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 27, "text": "主要原料。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1790, "w": 193, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "主要原料。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1790, "w": 193, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 28, "text": "（2）蜡染：布依族最负盛名的纺织印染工艺。史籍有关蜡染的记载也较多，如据《宋", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1855, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（2）蜡染：布依族最负盛名的纺织印染工艺。史籍有关蜡染的记载也较多，如据《宋", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 1855, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 29, "text": "史》载：“南宁州（今惠水一带）特产•⋯蜜蜡、蜡染布等。”蜡染的制作方法，据乾隆年间", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1923, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "史》载：“南宁州（今惠水一带）特产•⋯蜜蜡、蜡染布等。”蜡染的制作方法，据乾隆年间", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 1923, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 30, "text": "《贵州通志》记载：“先用蜡绘花于布而后染之；既染，去蜡而后见花。”今天的布依族蜡染", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1983, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "《贵州通志》记载：“先用蜡绘花于布而后染之；既染，去蜡而后见花。”今天的布依族蜡染", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 1983, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 31, "text": "制作工艺也大致如此。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2056, "w": 390, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "制作工艺也大致如此。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2056, "w": 390, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 32, "text": "布依族蜡染布的花纹图案多为花草或几何图形，常见的有藤菜花、团花、波纹、三角、", "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 2120, "w": 1467, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族蜡染布的花纹图案多为花草或几何图形，常见的有藤菜花、团花、波纹、三角、", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 205, "y": 2120, "w": 1467, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 33, "text": "云雷纹、太阳（圆圈）等十几种。蜡染布多用于妇女服饰上，有的地区则用作床单、被面、", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2185, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "云雷纹、太阳（圆圈）等十几种。蜡染布多用于妇女服饰上，有的地区则用作床单、被面、", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2185, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 49, "line_no": 34, "text": "帐檐等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2245, "w": 149, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "帐檐等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 125, "y": 2245, "w": 149, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
